  "steps": [
    "Cut the top, two bench tops, four legs and six aprons to the small dimensions.",
    "Screw the legs to the aprons with glue, then screw the aprons under the table top.",
    "Cut the bench seats and screw each to two legs through the apron.",
    "Round over every edge a knee or elbow will meet, then sand smooth.",
    "Brush on three coats of chalkboard paint on the table top and one coat of sealer on the rest."
